# The assembled multi-course site that site/build_all.py writes (regenerable).
# Anchored with a leading slash, so it means THIS directory's _site and nothing
# deeper: each course keeps its own .gitignore, with its own /_site/ rule that
# anchors to the course directory. Do not hoist those rules up here — a leading
# slash anchors a pattern to the directory holding the .gitignore, so every one
# of them would silently stop matching, and three of the optimization course's
# name private working notes.
/_site/

# Bytecode from site/build_all.py. Each course ignores its own; this covers site/.
__pycache__/
